A Python CLI for working with LinkedIn from the terminal: profile and company lookups, search, and a write system that defaults to dry runs for posting, messaging and profile edits. It also has saved searches, templates, light contact tracking and a discovery queue that ranks leads from search, inbox and engagement. Published on PyPI as `linkedin-discovery-cli`.
